{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome Your Fears is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game you are exploring the story of 19-year-old Steve Jackson, who takes a job house-sitting for friends while they are on vacation. What starts as a simple favor quickly turns into a chilling experience as unsettling events unfold in the quiet town. Little does Steve know, that these days will reveal dark secrets, and he must make choices that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game primarily features a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/forgif__1_.gif?t=1741361352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror elements with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive dialogues with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player voice activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique sound effects that create tension.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550490?t=1741361352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550490?t=1741361352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/29c2c05fc65e7de1b98a6cec69d7f1e1906a2f41/capsule_231x87.